{
    "title": "TMCARS",
    "description": "Awtoulag satmak we almak \u00fc\u00e7in ni\u00fdetlenen TMCARS programmasynda a\u0148satlyk bilen \u00f6zi\u0148ize gerekli awtoulagy tapyp \u00fda-da satyp bilersi\u0148iz. Awtoulaglary\u0148 i\u00e7inde her d\u00fcrli kategori\u00fdalar bo\u00fdun\u00e7a: amatly bahaly, t\u00e4zeler, markasy we modeli, \u00fdyly we \u00fderle\u015f\u00fd\u00e4n \u00fderi bo\u00fdun\u00e7a g\u00f6zlegden pe\u00fddalanyp bilersi\u0148iz.\r\n\r\nM\u00fcmkin\u00e7ilikleri:\r\n- Satlyk awtoulaglary g\u00f6rmek\r\n- Her d\u00fcrli g\u00f6zlegden pe\u00fddalanmak\r\n- Awtoulag satmak \u00fc\u00e7in bildiri\u015f go\u015fmak\r\n- Awto \u015fa\u00fd satmak \u00fc\u00e7in bildiri\u015f go\u015fmak\r\n- Be\u00fdleki zatlary satmak \u00fc\u00e7in bildiri\u015f go\u015fmak\r\n- Habarlary okamak\r\n\r\nBizi\u0148 bilen habarla\u015fmak \u00fc\u00e7in programmany\u0148 i\u00e7inden g\u00f6ni administratora \u00fdazyp bilersi\u0148iz \u00fda-da info@tmcars.info, po\u00e7ta adresimize \u00fdazyp bilersi\u0148iz.\r\n\r\nGi\u0148i\u015fle\u00fdin maglumatlar:\r\nhttps://tmcars.info/home/contactUs\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTMCARS - The first Android application of its kind for buying and selling cars.\r\nThe most popular car resource in Turkmenistan. In this application you will find: the largest database of ads for the sale of new and used cars, the most detailed catalogs of models.\r\n\r\nCapabilities:\r\n- Browse and search for different cars\r\n- Placing a car for sale\r\n\r\nContacts\r\nhttps://tmcars.info/home/contactUs",
    "descriptionHTML": "Awtoulag satmak we almak \u00fc\u00e7in ni\u00fdetlenen TMCARS programmasynda a\u0148satlyk bilen \u00f6zi\u0148ize gerekli awtoulagy tapyp \u00fda-da satyp bilersi\u0148iz. Awtoulaglary\u0148 i\u00e7inde her d\u00fcrli kategori\u00fdalar bo\u00fdun\u00e7a: amatly bahaly, t\u00e4zeler, markasy we modeli, \u00fdyly we \u00fderle\u015f\u00fd\u00e4n \u00fderi bo\u00fdun\u00e7a g\u00f6zlegden pe\u00fddalanyp bilersi\u0148iz.<br><br>M\u00fcmkin\u00e7ilikleri:<br>- Satlyk awtoulaglary g\u00f6rmek<br>- Her d\u00fcrli g\u00f6zlegden pe\u00fddalanmak<br>- Awtoulag satmak \u00fc\u00e7in bildiri\u015f go\u015fmak<br>- Awto \u015fa\u00fd satmak \u00fc\u00e7in bildiri\u015f go\u015fmak<br>- Be\u00fdleki zatlary satmak \u00fc\u00e7in bildiri\u015f go\u015fmak<br>- Habarlary okamak<br><br>Bizi\u0148 bilen habarla\u015fmak \u00fc\u00e7in programmany\u0148 i\u00e7inden g\u00f6ni administratora \u00fdazyp bilersi\u0148iz \u00fda-da info@tmcars.info, po\u00e7ta adresimize \u00fdazyp bilersi\u0148iz.<br><br>Gi\u0148i\u015fle\u00fdin maglumatlar:<br>https://tmcars.info/home/contactUs<br><br><br><br>TMCARS - The first Android application of its kind for buying and selling cars.<br>The most popular car resource in Turkmenistan. In this application you will find: the largest database of ads for the sale of new and used cars, the most detailed catalogs of models.<br><br>Capabilities:<br>- Browse and search for different cars<br>- Placing a car for sale<br><br>Contacts<br>https://tmcars.info/home/contactUs",
